      "nets": [
        "Net-(U9-Pad2)",
        "Net-(U9-Pad4)"
      ],
      "observed": "The netlist includes an extra 74LVC1G86 XOR gate, U9. U9 pin 2 is connected to Net-(U9-Pad2), which also contains J1 pin 1 and U2 pin 2 (the U2 thermocouple T- input). U9 pin 4 is connected to Net-(U9-Pad4), which also contains U3 pin 8, the MAX31855 no-connect pin. Therefore U3 pin 8 is not left unconnected, unlike U2 and U4.",
      "expected": "The specification states that the three thermocouple channels are identical and that pin 8 (NC) is left unconnected on all three MAX31855 devices, with unconnected-(U2/U3/U4-NC-Pad8) nets. No XOR gate should be inserted into the thermocouple sensing path.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Pin 8 (`NC`) is left unconnected on all three parts (confirmed: `unconnected-(U2/U3/U4-NC-Pad8)` nets in `controller.net`)."
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"U9\") (value \"74LVC1G86\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"35\") (name \"Net-(U9-Pad2)\") (class \"Default\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U2\") (pin \"2\") (pinfunction \"T-\") (pintype \"passive\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"36\") (name \"Net-(U9-Pad4)\") (class \"Default\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U3\") (pin \"8\") (pinfunction \"NC\") (pintype \"passive\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"U9\") (pin \"4\") (pintype \"output\"))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The thermocouple front-end is not the specified identical three-channel design. U2's T- input is loaded by an external logic gate input, and U3's NC pin is driven by U9. This can introduce leakage, capacitance, or noise into a thermocouple channel and represents a clear deviation from the intended schematic.",
      "confidence": 0.9
    }
  ],
  "summary": "An anomaly is present: an extra 74LVC1G86 XOR gate is wired into the thermocouple circuitry, connecting to U2's T- input and driving U3's NC pin, contradicting the specification that U3 pin 8 is unconnected and the three thermocouple channels are identical."
}

